# A microservice image builds from the repository root, so Turborepo can prune
# the workspace; only what the services need enters the context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!turbo.json
!apps/microservices
# The Go stub API is a service too, but it is Go: Turborepo does not prune it
# and no Nest image copies it.
apps/microservices/console-stubs
!packages/streaming
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/Dockerfile
